        dcterms:description "Vendors `datasets/mammalian_coat_markings/` with the reference JSON, the specimen photograph, the scout manifest, `paper_citations.bib` and the new `felid_body_profile.json` (knots, growth defaults, specimen scale estimates, Stein et al. 2013 proportion sources, honesty statement), all five files SHA-256-verified at runtime (`EXPECTED_SHA256`, L118-134; `verify_dataset_sha256`, L140-152). The four surface-FEM references (Dziuk 1988, Pinkall & Polthier 1993, Dziuk & Elliott 2013, Stein & Hayssen 2013) are cited with DOIs in the module docstring and this audit but are NOT in `paper_citations.bib`, which is SHA-pinned and was left untouched." ;
